<===> README.md
Like dart-sass, `@media`, `@supports`, other at-rules and `@extend` are not
allowed within nested declarations (e.g. via a mixin included in `b: {...}`),
also for CSS loaded with `meta.load-css()`.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> at_rule/input.scss
@mixin m {@foo bar {x: y}}
a {b: {@include m}}
<===> at_rule/error
Error: At-rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @mixin m {@foo bar {x: y}}
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 1:11  m()
  input.scss 2:8   root stylesheet
<===> at_rule/error-libsass
Error: At-rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @mixin m {@foo bar {x: y}}
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 1:11  m()
  ,
2 | a {b: {@include m}}
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:8   root stylesheet
<===>
================================================================================
<===> at_rule_childless/input.scss
@mixin m {@foo bar;}
a {b: {@include m}}
<===> at_rule_childless/error
Error: At-rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @mixin m {@foo bar;}
  |           ^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 1:11  m()
  input.scss 2:8   root stylesheet
<===> at_rule_childless/error-libsass
Error: At-rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @mixin m {@foo bar;}
  |           ^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 1:11  m()
  ,
2 | a {b: {@include m}}
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:8   root stylesheet
<===>
================================================================================
<===> extend/input.scss
.c {d: e}
@mixin m {@extend .c}
a {b: {@include m}}
<===> extend/error
Error: @extend may only be used within style rules.
  ,
2 | @mixin m {@extend .c}
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:11  m()
  input.scss 3:8   root stylesheet
<===> extend/error-libsass
Error: @extend may only be used within style rules.
  ,
2 | @mixin m {@extend .c}
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:11  m()
  ,
3 | a {b: {@include m}}
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 3:8   root stylesheet
<===>
================================================================================
<===> load_css/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
a {b: {@include meta.load-css("up")}}
<===> load_css/_up.scss
@media screen {x {y: z}}
<===> load_css/error
Error: Media rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @media screen {x {y: z}}
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  _up.scss 1:1    load-css()
  input.scss 2:8  root stylesheet
<===> load_css/error-libsass
Error: Media rules may not be used within nested declarations.
  ,
1 | @media screen {x {y: z}}
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  _up.scss 1:1    load-css()
  ,
2 | a {b: {@include meta.load-css("up")}}
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:8  root stylesheet
